# Phase 4 implementation session — 20261003T134509Z

## Scope and decisions
- Plan 05 is document 05 / Phase 4: typed request headers and protocol bodies.
- Started from completed Phase 3 local gates on branch `04-phase-03-remoting-transport`; created branch `05-phase-04-typed-headers-bodies`.
- Phase 4 has no network calls and may depend on common but not remoting; retain Java 5.5.1 oracle and fixture-backed wire names/validation.
- Changes will be grouped by feature and committed separately. P4-V01/V02/V03 are acceptance requirements.

## Initial inspection
- Clean tree before branch creation; Phase 3 commits were local and present.
