- P4-V01 first wave passes both directions. P4-V02 has unknown-field preservation and required-field coverage for initial headers; it is not yet exhaustive over every model. P4-V03 V1/V2 fixture normalization passes; broader body collection/omission coverage remains in progress.
- `REQUEST_CODES.md` distinguishes typed model completion from Phase 5 RPC implementation. Consumer extension families and transaction/reply/runtime inbound models are still outstanding; Phase 4 is not complete.
- Validation: protocol crate tests (18 unit + 4 integration + 1 fixture test); targeted Clippy; Maven `verify` (Java oracle self-test, 17 scenario manifest validation, 2 existing and 6 new Rust frames decoded); workspace metadata check and differential self-test.

